    "updateTime": "2026-11-21T09:50:00+08:00",
    "generalSituationZh": "一股東北季候風今日影響廣東。同時，隨著覆蓋華南沿岸的廣闊雲帶逐漸轉薄，該區天色短暫好轉。而一股達強風程度的偏東氣流會在下週初影響華南沿岸，該區雲量增多，氣溫略為回升。預料另一股東北季候風會在下星期二抵達華南沿岸，下週中期該區氣溫再度下降及有幾陣雨。",
    "generalSituationEn": "The northeast monsoon will affect Guangdong today. Meanwhile, with the broad band of clouds covering the coast of southern China thinning out gradually, the weather will improve briefly over the region. A strong easterly airstream will affect the coast of southern China early next week. It will be cloudier with temperatures rising slightly over the region. Another surge of the northeast monsoon is expected to reach the coast of southern China next Tuesday. Temperatures will fall again and there will be a few rain patches over the region midweek next week.",
